++| action | busy(丢弃) | 空列表(真零) |
++|---|---|---|
++| `pinAssets` | `null` | `0` |
++| `removeAssets` | `null` | `{ unpinned: 0, excluded: 0 }` |
++| `restoreAssets` | `null` | `0` |
